<title>UK: BayerVB sets 100 million stg six-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 100 million stg six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    31.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.12    PAY DATE  L-23.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.52     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.6	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
